Package: pulzr-ip
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-ip
Description: Requests to devices on the gateway's LAN for their codecs, on pulzr-edge.
 A device that speaks its own protocol over IP (an IP camera's settings API)
 is driven by its device type's codec in Pulzar, which turns each command into
 HTTP, TCP or UDP requests; this makes them, against that device's address on
 the LAN and nothing else. Nothing device-specific is on the gateway.
